{"ts":"2026-08-07T13:01:18.790Z","author":"codex","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"50e451cc0f2b325ca259444b","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-vcs-op2c"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Make every production TypeScript script part of exact coverage and add lint and duplication gates"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The current exact coverage gate reports 100/100/100 for its configured source set but omits accept-native-toon.ts and accept-stat-cache.ts; the package also has no explicit ESLint or jscpd release gate. Add behavior-driven instrumentation for every production script, a meaningful statement/branch/function/line contract where the runner supports it, parser-aware lint for the mandatory TypeScript rules, and a fail-closed duplicate-code gate without artificial tests or exclusions."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":0},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["coverage","docstrings","duplication","lint","quality","release-blocker","typescript"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-07T13:01:18.790Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-07T13:01:18.790Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":480},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Every source and production script is instrumented by the repository coverage command; every supported coverage dimension is exactly 100%; ESLint enforces no explicit any, no inline or dynamic imports, erasable syntax, and repository conventions; jscpd or an equivalently strict duplicate-code detector runs fail-closed; release:check and prepublishOnly include all gates; tests are behavioral a